  "published": "2026-07-06T15:18:43.857Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Preview 5 adds 'alwasp app set-package-id' for assigning a fresh deployment\n      package ID to an existing .app file so it can be re-uploaded to a Business\n      Central sandbox without recompiling. Workspace restore now selects the highest\n      full Business Central application/platform version across selected projects and\n      uses the target application version as the locked restore floor for target-major\n      symbol packages, fixing mixed-minor builds such as BC 28.0/28.1 workspaces.\n      See CHANGELOG.md for full details.",
